The law text in this repository is the Constitution of the Autonomous Region of Bougainville, as adopted by the
Bougainville Constituent Assembly on 12 November 2004, taken from the copy published by the Autonomous Bougainville
Government (https://abg.gov.pg/government/constitution, read on 30 October 2026). The site carries no licence
statement. The text is reproduced as an official publication of the Autonomous Bougainville Government, with
attribution to it.

Source: Autonomous Bougainville Government. This repository is not an official publication.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement, the commit messages, the tables and the tools) are dedicated to the
public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
